                <note rend="inline" type="source">863.00/866a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in Austria</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Kliefoth</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-02-15T11:00:00-05:00">February 15, 1934—11
                        a.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>7. Please report more frequently during this crisis including pertinent
                    information on the welfare of Americans in Austria.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
